{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55908","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十五 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微微细雨下多时，百卉抽枝长不知。\n正化叵兴民自赡，叵兴民赡亦如斯。\n天观万物如刍狗，有覆无心更望伊。\n不因无事在林在，争觉王侯有此资。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}